{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Version: Pre-Alpha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is currently available?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1- 9 Fish to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2- Fish animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3- Social behavior system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- Feed system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5- Cleaning system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6- Sell system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7- Tank switch system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is currently Not available?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  1- Decoration system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2- Automation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3- More than 2 tanks. (awaiting feedback on tank switch system only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- Snow cabin (2nd stage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5- Temperature preference, size, and other fish traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  FTS is a game made by a solo developer, created on October 8th, 2025. It\u2019s my 4th game attempt after 3 years of development. The main inspiration was a Facebook game I loved called Fishville. However, that game wouldn\u2019t work well as an offline, session-based game, so I added more features over time, and it became its own standalone title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or would like to provide feedback, I\u2019d greatly appreciate it, just join the Discord and share your thoughts there. I genuinely hope you enjoy my game from the bottom of my heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More will be described as the development process progresses.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338720?t=1764769846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338720?t=1764769846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338720/51719fe6c3b95f8e3134da2291022b35bdd47056/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764769846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338720/51719fe6c3b95f8e3134da2291022b35bdd47056/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764769846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Version: Pre-Alpha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is currently available?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1- 9 Fish to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2- Fish animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3- Social behavior system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- Feed system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5- Cleaning system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6- Sell system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7- Tank switch system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is currently Not available?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  1- Decoration system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2- Automation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3- More than 2 tanks. (awaiting feedback on tank switch system only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4- Snow cabin (2nd stage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5- Temperature preference, size, and other fish traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  FTS is a game made by a solo developer, created on October 8th, 2025. It\u2019s my 4th game attempt after 3 years of development. The main inspiration was a Facebook game I loved called Fishville. However, that game wouldn\u2019t work well as an offline, session-based game, so I added more features over time, and it became its own standalone title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or would like to provide feedback, I\u2019d greatly appreciate it, just join the Discord and share your thoughts there. I genuinely hope you enjoy my game from the bottom of my heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More will be described as the development process progresses.</i></p>","developers":["Kiba Frost"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338720/036413da6cc6bdfec88c3db615ec58165c65ffd1/header.jpg?t=1764769846","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3338720/1169977551/24f97843cbc7aad025725c4ed82c286a0f5b394e/1764491556/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764496908","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3338720/1169977551/24f97843cbc7aad025725c4ed82c286a0f5b394e/1764491556/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764496908","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3338720/1169977551/24f97843cbc7aad025725c4ed82c286a0f5b394e/1764491556/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764496908","id":257086935,"name":"trailer1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086935/a3eb12ba9123b622bb26fb70bee9a00c5e078d71/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764496908"}],"name":"Fish Tank Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Sto